 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "This town went broke, legally, thanks to one line of fine print.",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 3.56
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "You see, the city needed cash, so it issued bonds. IOUs you can trade.",
   "s": 3.86,
   "e": 8.0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "And buried in the paperwork was a clause that let the buyer cash out early, at a higher rate.",
   "s": 8.34,
   "e": 13.42
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "Nobody thought it would matter. The rate looked safe.",
   "s": 13.6,
   "e": 16.0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "Then the market moved, and the clause turned into a loaded weapon.",
   "s": 16.26,
   "e": 19.74
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "Every bond the city sold, the buyers could flip back at triple the price.",
   "s": 19.98,
   "e": 23.86
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "The city borrowed to pay the interest. Which made new bonds. Which made new interest.",
   "s": 24.24,
   "e": 28.92
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "It was a debt that ate itself. And grew.",
   "s": 29.16,
   "e": 29.97
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "Officials called it a liquidity event. The accountants called it a fire.",
   "s": 29.97,
   "e": 30.57
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "text": "The mayor's office sold the water works, the parking meters, the street lights.",
   "s": 30.57,
   "e": 31.22
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "text": "Anything that wasn't bolted down went on the block to plug the hole.",
   "s": 31.22,
   "e": 31.87
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "text": "And the craziest part? The clause had been standard boilerplate for decades.",
   "s": 31.87,
   "e": 32.47
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "text": "The people who wrote it never expected anyone to read it, let alone use it.",
   "s": 32.47,
   "e": 33.22
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "text": "By the time they fixed the wording, the city had lost a generation of public works.",
   "s": 33.22,
   "e": 34.02
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "text": "All because one paragraph said \"subject to market adjustment\" instead of \"subject to market adjustment, capped.\"",
   "s": 34.02,
   "e": 64.3
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "text": "One word. That's what it cost.",
   "s": 64.48,
   "e": 65.72
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "text": "The loophole didn't break the city. The city broke itself, on autopilot.",
   "s": 66.1,
   "e": 70.16
  }
 ]
}